{"5012090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Restaurant & Farming Simulator", "steam_appid": 5012090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Sea to Counter! Fish Restaurant &amp; Farming Simulator is a fishing, farming and restaurant management sim where you build your own seaside place from scratch. Explore a colorful coastal town! Head out to the pier to fish, grow your own ingredients in the garden out back, run machines to turn your harvest into better products, and cook the famous Turkish fish sandwich for your hungry guests. Build the place you pictured, decorate it your way, hire staff and turn your little grill stand into a five-star restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATCH IT FRESH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your rod, head out to the pier and cast into the turquoise water. Whatever you pull in today is what goes on the menu tonight. Fill your crate and carry it back to the kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR OWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the garden behind the restaurant. Sow, water and harvest your own ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRILL THE FAMOUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the one they came for. Chop, grill and build the famous Turkish fish sandwich — then keep growing your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT FROM SCRATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your machines and close the loop yourself. Harvest goes in, finished goods come out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIRE YOUR CREW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff and let your supply keep running on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SERVE THE HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the counter and keep the orders moving. Guests line up and every plate earns you money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your restaurant in your own style and make every corner yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/42a81b725a1756982e816cc450b232d3.gif?t=1785574805\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/42a81b725a1756982e816cc450b232d3.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Sea to Counter! Fish Restaurant &amp; Farming Simulator is a fishing, farming and restaurant management sim where you build your own seaside place from scratch. Explore a colorful coastal town! Head out to the pier to fish, grow your own ingredients in the garden out back, run machines to turn your harvest into better products, and cook the famous Turkish fish sandwich for your hungry guests. Build the place you pictured, decorate it your way, hire staff and turn your little grill stand into a five-star restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATCH IT FRESH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your rod, head out to the pier and cast into the turquoise water. Whatever you pull in today is what goes on the menu tonight. Fill your crate and carry it back to the kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/9f79bfca72259b8bc7070c3c51b1f52c.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR OWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the garden behind the restaurant. Sow, water and harvest your own ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/d98c313ff69d39165b11540e73d829ba.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRILL THE FAMOUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the one they came for. Chop, grill and build the famous Turkish fish sandwich — then keep growing your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/440a27b4da7122ff3a4f925be6da3304.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT FROM SCRATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your machines and close the loop yourself. Harvest goes in, finished goods come out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/cd4d829159443dfd810b119df6fa1d46.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIRE YOUR CREW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff and let your supply keep running on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1450801a7d0d336ac00801e6f14a1a5c.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SERVE THE HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the counter and keep the orders moving. Guests line up and every plate earns you money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.webm?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/1c75701c42815b3497aa5b1f58976bfe.mp4?t=1785574805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your restaurant in your own style and make every corner yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/42a81b725a1756982e816cc450b232d3.gif?t=1785574805\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/extras/42a81b725a1756982e816cc450b232d3.poster.avif?t=1785574805\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Catch fresh fish off the turquoise coast, grow your own vegetables, and grill the famous Turkish fish sandwich. Harvest, chop and serve — hire staff, add production machines, and turn your little seaside grill into a five-star restaurant.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Indonesian, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Russian, Turkish, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012090/5269970b64883e7c8cd6bf4245e08dbffcbab103/header.jpg?t=1785574805", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app